#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting in Qiskit v2.0.0, only 64-bit platforms are supported and 32-bit platforms are not supported. You will not be able to build from source\n"
"on 32-bit platforms either, as internally the Qiskit Rust code assumes a 64-bit pointer width.\n"
msgstr "A partir de Qiskit v2.0.0, solo se admiten plataformas de 64 bits y no se admiten plataformas de 32 bits. Tampoco podrás compilar desde el código fuente en plataformas de 32 bits, ya que internamente el código Rust de Qiskit asume un ancho de puntero de 64 bits.\n"

